4035-4038">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4038-4050"><rb>日</rb><rt>ひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4050-4053">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4053-4068"><rb>覺</rb><rt>おぼ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4068-4074">えて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4074-4086"><rb>居</rb><rt>ゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4086-4098">る。むら</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4098-4113"><rb>雨</rb><rt>さめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4113-4116">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4116-4140"><rb>吹通</rb><rt>ふきとほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4140-4146">した</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4146-4161"><rb>風</rb><rt>かぜ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4161-4167">に、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4167-4197"><rb>大火鉢</rb><rt>おほひばち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4197-4200">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4200-4233"><rb>貝殼灰</rb><rt>かひがらばひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4233-4248">――これは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4248-4272"><rb>大降</rb><rt>おほぶり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4272-4284">のあとの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4284-4305"><rb>昨夜</rb><rt>さくや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4305-4308">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4308-4323"><rb>泊</rb><rt>とま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4323-4332">りに、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4332-4347"><rb>何</rb><rt>なん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4347-4356">となく</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4356-4371"><rb>寂</rb><rt>さみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4371-4398">しかつた――それが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4398-4410"><rb>日</rb><rt>ひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4410-4425">ざかりにも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4425-4440"><rb>寒</rb><rt>さむ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4440-4454">かつた。</seg